		{"id":"start-here","type":"text","text":"# 1. Start Here — Entry & Authority\n\nRead in order before touching architecture, specs, or code:\n\n- [SESSION_START.md](SESSION_START.md)\n- [Repository README](README.md)\n- [Decision Log](Decisions/Decision%20Log.md)","x":-1050,"y":320,"width":310,"height":260,"color":"1"},
