		{"id":"core-architecture","type":"text","text":"# 4. Core & Frozen Architecture\n\n- [Phase 1 Architectural Assessment](docs/architecture/CC_Phase%201_Architectural%20Assessment.md)\n- [Phase 3 Architecture Record](docs/architecture/CC_Phase%203%20Architecture%20Record.md)\n- [UI Architecture Specification v1.0](docs/architecture/CC_UI%20Architecture%20Specification%20v1.0.md)\n- [WP13 Phase 4 Architectural Decision Record](docs/architecture/WP13_Phase_4_Architectural_Decision_Record.md)","x":-1050,"y":1200,"width":310,"height":330,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"matrix","type":"text","text":"# 5. Phase 4 Matrix (All 33 Files)\n\nRead Docs B, C, and D in full every session; read Doc A by topic (see File Index §6).\n\n- [Reusable Chunk Prompt Template](docs/architecture/phase-4-matrix/Reusable%20Chunk%20Prompt%20Template.txt)","x":-700,"y":320,"width":310,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"acp-decisions","type":"text","text":"# 6. Architecture Decisions (ACPs)\n\n- [ACP-008 ProjectStatus reconciliation](CC_Working_Notes/ACP-008_Proposal_Status_Enum_Reconciliation.md) (in CC_Working_Notes)\n- [ACP-009 ProjectStatus enum](docs/architecture/ACP-009_ProjectStatus_Enum_Reconciliation.md)\n- [ACP-010 Retire category paging](docs/architecture/ACP-010_Retire_Category_Level_Sibling_Paging_After_Gateway.md)\n- [ACP-011 Gateway mapping](docs/architecture/ACP-011%20%E2%80%94%20Gateway%20Destination-to-View%20Mapping%20and%20Category%20Screen%20Retirement%20Boundary.md)\n- [ACP-012 Root depth: Gateway](docs/architecture/ACP-012%20%E2%80%94%20Rename%20Root%20Navigation%20Depth%20from%20Category%20to%20Gateway.md)\n- [ACP-013 New Project lifecycle](docs/architecture/ACP-013%20%E2%80%94%20New%20Project%20Representation%20and%20Navigation%20Lifecycle.md)\n- [ACP-014 Purpose and Description](docs/architecture/ACP-014%20%E2%80%94%20Purpose%20and%20Description%20Metadata%20Representation.md)\n- [ACP-015 AI Progress Estimate](docs/architecture/ACP-015%20%E2%80%94%20AI%20Progress%20Estimate%20-%20Architectural%20Reconciliation.md)\n- [ACP-016 Dashboard resolution](docs/architecture/ACP-016%20%E2%80%94%20Dashboard%20ProjectRecord%20Resolution%20%28Missing,%20Invalid,%20Duplicate%29.md)\n\nACP-001 to ACP-007 are in [Phase 3 Architecture Record](docs/architecture/CC_Phase%203%20Architecture%20Record.md).","x":-350,"y":320,"width":310,"height":540,"color":"1"},
