		{"id":"working-notes-active","type":"text","text":"# 9. Working Notes — Scopes, Roadmaps & Candidates\n\n*Context & evidence trail — not automatically authoritative.*\n\n- [CC_Working_Notes README](CC_Working_Notes/README.md)\n- [Near-Term Roadmap (2026-10-02)](CC_Working_Notes/CC%20%E2%80%94%20Near-Term%20Roadmap%202026%3A10%3A02.md)\n- [Dashboard Core-Content Scope (2026-10-09)](CC_Working_Notes/CC%20%E2%80%94%20Dashboard%20Core-Content%20Specification%20Scope%202026-10-09.md)\n- [Dashboard Resolution Gap Brief](CC_Working_Notes/Dashboard%20ProjectRecord%20Resolution%20Gap%20%E2%80%94%20Evidence%20and%20Decision%20Scope.md)\n- [Purpose/Description Ownership Open Question](CC_Working_Notes/Purpose_Description_Ownership_Open_Question.md)\n- [New Project Intake Candidate Notes](CC_Working_Notes/CC_Phase%204_New%20Project%20Intake%20and%20Data%20Model%20%E2%80%94%20Candidate%20Design%20Notes.md)\n- [Gateway & Ongoing/Archived Distinction](CC_Working_Notes/CC_Phase_4_Gateway_Screen_and_Ongoing_Archived_Distinction.md)\n- [Document E — Uncharted Territory](CC_Working_Notes/Document-E-Uncharted-Territory.md)\n- [Visual Portfolio Representation Candidate](CC_Working_Notes/Visual_Portfolio_Representation_Candidate.md)","x":0,"y":320,"width":310,"height":640,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"done-foundation","type":"text","text":"# Foundation & Data\n\n**WP10 · WP11**\n\nImplementation foundation and Project Record data layer.\n\n[WP10 Specification (final)](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP10%20Implementation%20Foundation%20Specification%20%28final%29.md)\n\n[Master Implementation Index (WP11)](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)","x":360,"y":320,"width":300,"height":280,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"done-gateway","type":"text","text":"# Gateway & Provider\n\n**WP13 · WP14**\n\nGateway root navigation and the Obsidian ProjectRecord provider are implemented and verified.\n\n[Gateway Implementation Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_Gateway%20Implementation%20Specification.md)\n\n[WP13 Project List Screen Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP13%20Phase%203%20Project%20List%20Screen%20Specification.md)\n\n[WP14 ProjectRecordProvider Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP14%20Obsidian%20ProjectRecordProvider%20Specification.md)","x":360,"y":640,"width":300,"height":405,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"done-dashboard","type":"text","text":"# Dashboard Core\n\n**WP15 · WP16**\n\nResolution handling and Dashboard core content implemented. WP16 closure decisions remain open.\n\n[WP15 Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP15%20Dashboard%20Implementation%20Specification.md)\n\n[WP16 Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP16%20Dashboard%20Core-Content%20Specification.md)","x":360,"y":1100,"width":300,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"wp12","type":"text","text":"# WP12 — Up Button Verification\n\n**Status:** Pending verification\n\nVerify the `goUp()` success path. Current framework verification cannot exercise it because no controller action sets `depth` to `workspace`.\n\n**Next action:** Resolve the verification gap and determine whether an implementation change is needed.\n\n[WP12 Implementation Notes](docs/implementation/CC_Phase%204_WP12%20Implementation%20Notes.md)\n\n[Slice 9B Verification Protocol](docs/verification/WP12%20Step%205%20-%20Slice%209B%20Framework%20Verification%20Protocol.md)","x":720,"y":320,"width":300,"height":480,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"wp16","type":"text","text":"# WP16 — Dashboard Decisions\n\n**Status:** Pending architectural rulings\n\n- **Blockers display:** Reconcile WP16 D2 with UI Architecture Specification §6.\n- **Staleness:** Decide how stale Dashboard information is identified and presented.\n\n**Next action:** Resolve both rulings and update the authoritative documentation.\n\n[WP16 Specification](docs/specifications/CC_Phase%204_WP16%20Dashboard%20Core-Content%20Specification.md)\n\n[UI Architecture Specification](docs/architecture/CC_UI%20Architecture%20Specification%20v1.0.md)","x":720,"y":843,"width":300,"height":537,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"workspace","type":"text","text":"# Project Workspace\n\nReconcile Dashboard/Workspace requirements before defining the Workspace specification.\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)\n\n[Near-Term Roadmap](CC_Working_Notes/CC%20%E2%80%94%20Near-Term%20Roadmap%202026%3A10%3A02.md)","x":1080,"y":320,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"later","type":"text","text":"# Remaining Work\n\n- Dashboard Attention and Workspace navigation\n- Dashboard-to-Workspace action\n- Staleness and AI Progress Estimate derivation\n- New Project creation and persistence\n\n[Master Implementation Index](docs/indexes/CC_Phase%204_Master%20Implementation%20Index.md)","x":1080,"y":610,"width":300,"height":350,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"future-architecture","type":"text","text":"# Tool Ecosystem & Host Independence\n\nEvolve CC toward an independent project operating environment with a configurable tool ecosystem. Reduce dependence on Obsidian as host while retaining its capabilities through supported integrations.\n\nUsers configure tools globally and per project, including third-party apps, AI providers, and native CC extensions.\n\n**Status:** Future consideration — not an approved specification or implementation commitment.","x":1440,"y":320,"width":300,"height":480,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"working-notes-handovers","type":"text","text":"# 10. Handovers, Audits & Historical Drafts\n\n*Historical context — superseded where newer specs/ACPs exist.*\n\n- [Handover Claude to Claude (2026-10-06)](CC_Working_Notes/CC%20%E2%80%94%20Handover%20Claude%20to%20Claude%282026-10-06%29.md)\n- [Handover Claude to GPT (2026-10-06)](CC_Working_Notes/CC%20%E2%80%94%20Handover%20Claude%20to%20GPT%20%282026-10-06%29.md)\n- [Handover GPT to GPT (2026-10-06)](CC_Working_Notes/CC%20%E2%80%94%20Handover%20GPT%20to%20GPT%20%282026-10-06%29.md)\n- [State of Repo for Codex (2026-09-25)](CC_Working_Notes/CC_State_of_Repo_for_Codex_2026-09-25.md)\n- [Codex Audit (2026-09-29)](CC_Working_Notes/Codex%20Audit%20-%20Current%20repository%20state%202026%3A09%3A29.md)\n- [Codex CC Roadmap (2026-09-13)](CC_Working_Notes/Codex%20CC%20Roadmap%202026.09.13.txt)\n- [Working_Notes name change](CC_Working_Notes/Working_Notes%20name%20change.md)\n- [WP10 Foundation Spec (draft)](CC_Working_Notes/Downloaded%20Docs/CC_Phase%204_WP10%20Implementation%20Foundation%20Specification%20%28draft%29.md)\n- [UI Architecture Spec (draft)](CC_Working_Notes/Downloaded%20Docs/CC_UI%20Architecture%20Specification%20%28draft%29.md)","x":0,"y":1000,"width":310,"height":580,"color":"1"},
